# Image assets must reach disk byte-for-byte. Git's `text=auto` heuristic decides
# binary-ness by scanning for NUL bytes, which silently misfires on files that are
# structurally binary but happen to contain none -- it corrupted the app's PDF test
# fixture that way (exifcleaner#305). Listed explicitly rather than trusting it.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
